  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.693939,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Cities given, the problem was to light them.",
      "output_sha256": "53628b96f6f1e230e41fcdadee622a2e3730b5a9e0e282ad0fc4458924bc134c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "53628b96f6f1e230e41fcdadee622a2e3730b5a9e0e282ad0fc4458924bc134c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "How to conduct individual citizens about the burgess-warren, when once heaven had withdrawn its leading luminary? or—since we live in a scientific age—when once our spinning planet has turned its back upon the sun?",
      "output_sha256": "f56ea844dce57993171831b4c22d879092b2a7e5e74e633943a01f00fd26e813",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "f56ea844dce57993171831b4c22d879092b2a7e5e74e633943a01f00fd26e813",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The moon, from time to time, was doubtless very helpful; the stars had a cheery look among the chimney-pots; and a cresset here and there, on church or citadel, produced a fine pictorial effect, and, in places where the ground lay unevenly, held out the right hand of conduct to the benighted.",
      "output_sha256": "3bf5035f178ae2cfc8fdb2365643b1dc62172ade30e13510b069f857776c40ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "3bf5035f178ae2cfc8fdb2365643b1dc62172ade30e13510b069f857776c40ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, when the sun, moon, and stars were obscured or absent, the nighttime traveler had to rely on—according to old illustrations—tall, stable lanterns, two stories high.",
      "output_sha256": "219f616afdbf4f5bc0455688d858ae2843d489805b997da2e67a824619d5c84b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.456133,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "79421f37bd5d31ab7e90b17cc2ba6ca9555e3ff6a3ea54d78a45756e470418b2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "219f616afdbf4f5bc0455688d858ae2843d489805b997da2e67a824619d5c84b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Many holes, drilled in the conical turret-roof of this vagabond Pharos, let up spouts of dazzlement into the bearer’s eyes; and as he paced forth in the ghostly darkness, carrying his own sun by a ring about his finger, day and night swung to and fro and up and down about his footsteps.",
      "output_sha256": "e94fb154c9ded2ccefe62a173678ae5c544d256bba68afe91d4d8321242de586",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "e94fb154c9ded2ccefe62a173678ae5c544d256bba68afe91d4d8321242de586",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Blackness haunted his path; he was beleaguered by goblins as he went; and, curfew being struck, he found no light but that he travelled in throughout the township.",
      "output_sha256": "9937264378525d7eb5f552068a14ab3b828d177c92d94ef81e30d4f17b58b38f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "9937264378525d7eb5f552068a14ab3b828d177c92d94ef81e30d4f17b58b38f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Closely following on this epoch of migratory lanthorns in a world of extinction, came the era of oil-lights, hard to kindle, easy to extinguish, pale and wavering in the hour of their endurance.",
      "output_sha256": "049f70f0fdbefb7056d6be10c0cc71c2b7f1b644f016407b582f2a30694ed7b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "049f70f0fdbefb7056d6be10c0cc71c2b7f1b644f016407b582f2a30694ed7b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Rudely puffed the winds of heaven; roguishly clomb up the all-destructive urchin; and, lo! in a moment night re-established her void empire, and the cit groped along the wall, suppered but bedless, occult from guidance, and sorrily wading in the kennels.",
      "output_sha256": "0070965cd3c317e5c4bc6457c60f53afce3bf1a30e4c687de7d3a9a7b55210e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "0070965cd3c317e5c4bc6457c60f53afce3bf1a30e4c687de7d3a9a7b55210e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "As if the playful winds and rambunctious youths weren’t enough, these fragile lights were often strung between houses, swinging above the thoroughfare.",
      "output_sha256": "97e14675b5a3a6b86dabe991331ac0bd1703fd775321e16ca1b260bbb1d47d43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.419231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "61534c9f6425d1c913aa7bf0c2754ca7b5787c2e29bc0b89a5e3ea56db53b3ac"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "97e14675b5a3a6b86dabe991331ac0bd1703fd775321e16ca1b260bbb1d47d43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There, on invisible cordage, let them swing!",
      "output_sha256": "793b619ec7d40c6a7fc8ae9e2ee96f88e5dc0197774b0676775aa68f0f31483c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "793b619ec7d40c6a7fc8ae9e2ee96f88e5dc0197774b0676775aa68f0f31483c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And suppose some crane-necked general to go speeding by on a tall charger, spurring the destiny of nations, red-hot in expedition, there would indubitably be some effusion of military blood, and oaths, and a certain crash of glass; and while the chieftain rode forward with a purple coxcomb, the street would be left to original darkness, unpiloted, unvoyageable, a province of the desert night.",
      "output_sha256": "4a4f55d12e7639c772b7ed5c089add33b115e03747e2819e0083ff2187c71525",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "4a4f55d12e7639c772b7ed5c089add33b115e03747e2819e0083ff2187c71525",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The conservative, reflecting on the past and the future, finds satisfaction in the progress achieved.",
      "output_sha256": "5c6045b7d810e850ab6ff9e3948674a2b860a4b8bd0a4217c3b560de32f82925",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.379555,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "346248cc8f6d8045e908b9a5cb122a954c642d5c3fd97c53e762856e6c885040"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5c6045b7d810e850ab6ff9e3948674a2b860a4b8bd0a4217c3b560de32f82925",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Out of the age of gas lamps he glances back slightingly at the mirk and glimmer in which his ancestors wandered; his heart waxes jocund at the contrast; nor do his lips refrain from a stave, in the highest style of poetry, lauding progress and the golden mean.",
      "output_sha256": "f0f5b68993c5ce8f8d53026686ccd7e33d1d59bc6d8e6c0b70a8b42a66eb6083",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0f5b68993c5ce8f8d53026686ccd7e33d1d59bc6d8e6c0b70a8b42a66eb6083",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When gas first spread along a city, mapping it forth about evenfall for the eye of observant birds, a new age had begun for sociality and corporate pleasure-seeking, and begun with proper circumstance, becoming its own birthright.",
      "output_sha256": "f0fdc0ea0934965c1ac86c56cfb0fc2f0991ff2d626b9687fef7c1111394c143",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0fdc0ea0934965c1ac86c56cfb0fc2f0991ff2d626b9687fef7c1111394c143",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This innovation was a significant step forward, allowing humanity to escape the constraints of fog and darkness.",
      "output_sha256": "5ba5adf2093a21e4932b0689b65ffcea2e93cca5107444edd4cccee12ff7ad15",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.319798,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1e8000be117756ff9bb5a749ca36bf22d1a499976e246a43cf8e46d44c1de96d",
        "c876787d04e0b36c8cb71afe2f29cec42bc750039b3c37c9eaedf09e37e2d858"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5ba5adf2093a21e4932b0689b65ffcea2e93cca5107444edd4cccee12ff7ad15",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Evening strolls were no longer a thing of the past; the promenade remained lively well after sunset, extending the day's pleasures for everyone.",
      "output_sha256": "dbf8a330d4cab43599ce3197cf947842ec949ff89e75c1be4f897798df368ef4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.319798,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1e8000be117756ff9bb5a749ca36bf22d1a499976e246a43cf8e46d44c1de96d",
        "c876787d04e0b36c8cb71afe2f29cec42bc750039b3c37c9eaedf09e37e2d858"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dbf8a330d4cab43599ce3197cf947842ec949ff89e75c1be4f897798df368ef4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The urban populace had their own stars—tame and obedient.",
      "output_sha256": "5341ce675c6aaf1cecdc07b3c09c2439b55a40636ce5afe68c7d82885a6938d4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.541667,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "13ab923810883ad737e6479ab05846edc5dc466c97723aa07fad1c030607a3e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5341ce675c6aaf1cecdc07b3c09c2439b55a40636ce5afe68c7d82885a6938d4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is true that these were not so steady, nor yet so clear, as their originals; nor indeed was their lustre so elegant as that of the best wax candles.",
      "output_sha256": "04140eab02b28025bb5b7402d6eeb374825e7de9bfcebcfd85fa54e1db189571",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "04140eab02b28025bb5b7402d6eeb374825e7de9bfcebcfd85fa54e1db189571",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But then the gas stars, being nearer at hand, were more practically efficacious than Jupiter himself.",
      "output_sha256": "5aeccc545809198a52c4a92cd6d26bafc3bba75e33e78eb877e7cb7e1f5e079f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "5aeccc545809198a52c4a92cd6d26bafc3bba75e33e78eb877e7cb7e1f5e079f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is true, again, that they did not unfold their rays with the appropriate spontaneity of the planets, coming out along the firmament one after another, as the need arises.",
      "output_sha256": "6c212f75df282741fcc60e1cc9f6a64bb8b03b1c2155988bdde963f47b27103b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "6c212f75df282741fcc60e1cc9f6a64bb8b03b1c2155988bdde963f47b27103b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Instead, the lamplighters would dash through the streets each evening, their enthusiasm evident.",
      "output_sha256": "d4c59aafff57f20aef4f4f58e8f5c13f2cd9c50e93ab79748443afb1c1cb2f3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.307262,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f8dc215fe1ff14e4b899d6713b999b274b98abc5a726c66f7a13842b573dcf0c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d4c59aafff57f20aef4f4f58e8f5c13f2cd9c50e93ab79748443afb1c1cb2f3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was pretty to see man thus emulating the punctuality of heaven’s orbs; and though perfection was not absolutely reached, and now and then an individual may have been knocked on the head by the ladder of the flying functionary, yet people commended his zeal in a proverb, and taught their children to say, “God bless the lamplighter!”",
      "output_sha256": "07b388ac09edcd3c56a9792f2f118414730b68265ee208220327d11ac3bfe145",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "07b388ac09edcd3c56a9792f2f118414730b68265ee208220327d11ac3bfe145",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And since his passage was a piece of the day’s programme, the children were well pleased to repeat the benediction, not, of course, in so many words, which would have been improper, but in some chaste circumlocution, suitable for infant lips.",
      "output_sha256": "a48bb60662c7048a8c3edc3763fd62f77062f6676cd175132993750ebd39b30c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "a48bb60662c7048a8c3edc3763fd62f77062f6676cd175132993750ebd39b30c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "God bless him, indeed!",
      "output_sha256": "cd6032e82a732754b855d0c204d8c7b67a33ea0a86e45efe5830b3becc8edf88",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "cd6032e82a732754b855d0c204d8c7b67a33ea0a86e45efe5830b3becc8edf88",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, the time for his diligent work is drawing to a close, and soon we will no longer see him racing down the street, punctuating the twilight with each illuminated lamp as he goes.",
      "output_sha256": "7e41c61028326c43c05cb749bb49e047df6664fbfde894ad64621815fa42bd71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.343256,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "300eddd7d3f9091dc15e151f3199b163cb8f223dcfe83c00b2ac0c9ff63eb6e2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7e41c61028326c43c05cb749bb49e047df6664fbfde894ad64621815fa42bd71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The Greeks would have made a noble myth of such an one; how he distributed starlight, and, as soon as the need was over, re-collected it; and the little bull’s-eye, which was his instrument, and held enough fire to kindle a whole parish, would have been fitly commemorated in the legend.",
      "output_sha256": "ba8c43b7b8eebc9f5b81c44a33e1eb66102dd649fe42955699eaad4693b0b983",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "ba8c43b7b8eebc9f5b81c44a33e1eb66102dd649fe42955699eaad4693b0b983",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Now, as with all heroic endeavors, his efforts are approaching an end.",
      "output_sha256": "ba537b89f0dafeff1d1cab774abc50a86ba3d93ea98b8225cc4b9dac02420d91",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.342445,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a26cf45e122e62914e5a9508b18ca27b9ad356460491df0aa46f40019f840c8a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ba537b89f0dafeff1d1cab774abc50a86ba3d93ea98b8225cc4b9dac02420d91",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For another advance has been effected.",
      "output_sha256": "5c03c829d6e19043173397bf166d8e84e51f068cce9ae0cba998bd4b6b0f3ec1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "5c03c829d6e19043173397bf166d8e84e51f068cce9ae0cba998bd4b6b0f3ec1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Our tame stars are to come out in future, not one by one, but all in a body and at once.",
      "output_sha256": "806dc02e764fe55762e89e05295710027d03cf1e9dbf9fd600b2e7a2218a4839",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "806dc02e764fe55762e89e05295710027d03cf1e9dbf9fd600b2e7a2218a4839",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "An electrician in a remote office flicks a switch—and suddenly, the entire city is awash in light!",
      "output_sha256": "012b8ac683be49240d81f8236f2d72c87a265e2d830351d6a5293ac978364f16",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.322668,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e2c157e5a801bbbac53af4078aae19cce6fa22d981610b8bc247b764d127c2d7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "012b8ac683be49240d81f8236f2d72c87a265e2d830351d6a5293ac978364f16",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Fiat Lux, the electrician declares.",
      "output_sha256": "da472c53bf963442d6f66970c17c083f4b0030b7ef3f9aef9bff7f55d09587be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.693939,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9b877ac933a59d0c502b8d803d86cffebc4b5ea50a448551cafc4b4afb5074a0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "da472c53bf963442d6f66970c17c083f4b0030b7ef3f9aef9bff7f55d09587be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "What a sight it is, on a clear evening from the heights of Hampstead Hill, when the sprawling urban landscape is revealed in an instant—a vast, shimmering design that stretches for miles.",
      "output_sha256": "47e514e05a9473eebe9cf65067a6340e30864721c5fcb0424e3e6352379a4124",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.432848,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "52b5e5e130458068fa3df2ea608299dd3a6bb72ff963aac5f232e3df955df021"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "47e514e05a9473eebe9cf65067a6340e30864721c5fcb0424e3e6352379a4124",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37,
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "On that night, all the street lamps burst into illumination together, creating a symphony of light!",
      "output_sha256": "f21916d643fdb45094b40a9b9b545eb3da3e2c847398efa316e9844d2b3255c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.432848,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "52b5e5e130458068fa3df2ea608299dd3a6bb72ff963aac5f232e3df955df021"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f21916d643fdb45094b40a9b9b545eb3da3e2c847398efa316e9844d2b3255c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37,
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This is the dawn of a new era, heralded recently by an experiment in Pall Mall.",
      "output_sha256": "939be5b4b70b417e9fc4857558dace32a22995f0e9eeee9091136eca83a0bb70",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.495703,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a806e7d90398f809a03bce14443f703653805afeb7fdaaf574152fdae16c1e67"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "939be5b4b70b417e9fc4857558dace32a22995f0e9eeee9091136eca83a0bb70",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Star-rise by electricity, the most romantic flight of civilisation; the compensatory benefit for an innumerable array of factories and bankers’ clerks.",
      "output_sha256": "3f3431124f44b31cda8cf19dbeb8e239bb9f1ed427ae3d178071f582a9c9cf44",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "3f3431124f44b31cda8cf19dbeb8e239bb9f1ed427ae3d178071f582a9c9cf44",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To the artistic spirit exercised about Thirlmere, here is a crumb of consolation; consolatory, at least, to such of them as look out upon the world through seeing eyes, and contentedly accept beauty where it comes.",
      "output_sha256": "d7ba7423e8531d8cfc20fd18d3f7a8c1f170bba3478d25aad9051d08414c96db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "d7ba7423e8531d8cfc20fd18d3f7a8c1f170bba3478d25aad9051d08414c96db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the conservative, while lauding progress, is ever timid of innovation; his is the hand upheld to counsel pause; his is the signal advising slow advance.",
      "output_sha256": "472dfa68b18e998d31cf869a3a9cb5a34621f43e3d5b1aec7b745d0fd9fc06e2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "472dfa68b18e998d31cf869a3a9cb5a34621f43e3d5b1aec7b745d0fd9fc06e2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The word electricity now sounds the note of danger.",
      "output_sha256": "99336cd6fa5c16f96bf2c45c7f2e88e89fa8c1e1c978e2dea64370e6833cb532",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "99336cd6fa5c16f96bf2c45c7f2e88e89fa8c1e1c978e2dea64370e6833cb532",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In Paris, at the entrance of the Passage des Princes, near the Opera House, and along Rue Drouot at the Figaro office, a new and disturbing form of urban illumination now flickers ominously at night—an unsettling sight, almost grotesque.",
      "output_sha256": "f7d2cd1b53b609add1c927cb3cecd6ea1f8506fd60ace0ff73544d726cf3248c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.532053,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fffed864c375a6df90b5001fb59613141bd96bff6eb8cd6c86c161aede9b3849"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f7d2cd1b53b609add1c927cb3cecd6ea1f8506fd60ace0ff73544d726cf3248c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Such a light as this should shine only on murders and public crime, or along the corridors of lunatic asylums, a horror to heighten horror.",
      "output_sha256": "f8857f31f2d0439909167fb5e07256075c4c029cf91a665f796b41fc17b46cc1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "f8857f31f2d0439909167fb5e07256075c4c029cf91a665f796b41fc17b46cc1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To look at it only once is to fall in love with gas, which gives a warm domestic radiance fit to eat by.",
      "output_sha256": "aaa93b8d44ff4662202b54c3946e8234f2cca68e6e95e72536bc825ae81a8745",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "aaa93b8d44ff4662202b54c3946e8234f2cca68e6e95e72536bc825ae81a8745",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Mankind, you would have thought, might have remained content with what Prometheus stole for them and not gone fishing the profound heaven with kites to catch and domesticate the wildfire of the storm.",
      "output_sha256": "eaf0a51f6823aa15d974628f996bcbe84f2b39c201a163397b9d420771e1cad5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "eaf0a51f6823aa15d974628f996bcbe84f2b39c201a163397b9d420771e1cad5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet here we have the levin brand at our doors, and it is proposed that we should henceforward take our walks abroad in the glare of permanent lightning.",
      "output_sha256": "2a9cad797ae69c150bd518568ae709d187edba849cc11c03c3d419f6f930f644",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a9cad797ae69c150bd518568ae709d187edba849cc11c03c3d419f6f930f644",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A man need not be very superstitious if he scruple to follow his pleasures by the light of the Terror that Flieth, nor very epicurean if he prefer to see the face of beauty more becomingly displayed.",
      "output_sha256": "d337eb334ce0880155d10ab49ae0b14c273b3d9b18216499bd81fa0d5cb365c3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "d337eb334ce0880155d10ab49ae0b14c273b3d9b18216499bd81fa0d5cb365c3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That ugly blinding glare may not improperly advertise the home of slanderous Figaro , which is a backshop to the infernal regions; but where soft joys prevail, where people are convoked to pleasure and the philosopher looks on smiling and silent, where love and laughter and deifying wine abound, there, at least, let the old mild lustre shine upon the ways of man.",
      "output_sha256": "bff95f8a98581484aac20623af964248723693d351147265db1cf7fde37c6223",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "bff95f8a98581484aac20623af964248723693d351147265db1cf7fde37c6223",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
